# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX)
# Create a GA4 property at https://analytics.google.com for your deployed domain,
# then paste the Measurement ID here as REACT_APP_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID.
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) for local dev, and set the same
# variable in your AWS build/deploy pipeline's environment for production.
# Leave blank to disable analytics entirely.
REACT_APP_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
